  trade/accounting data model.
- ADempiere and iDempiere communities: the dictionary rows, model classes, document actions
  and accounting rules this code ports, with file:line citations in the source.
  iDempiere is GPLv2.
- Libero / org.idempiere.mfg (e-Evolution, Victor Perez, and the contributors of the
  pshepetko and logilite forks): the Manufacturing plugin in erp/plugins/libero_*.mjs.
  GPLv2.

